निर्विघ्नं कुरु मे देव सर्वकार्येषु सर्वदा॥</p><span aria-hidden="true"></span><p>With the blessings of the Almighty and our elders, we joyfully invite you to celebrate the union of<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">ईश्वर एवं बड़ों के आशीर्वाद से, हम सहर्ष आपको इस पावन मिलन में आमंत्रित करते हैं</span></p><h1><span data-part="person"><span>Meera<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मीरा</span></span><span>Daughter of Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सुपुत्री श्रीमती सुनीता एवं श्री राजेश शर्मा</span></span></span><span>&amp;</span><span data-part="person"><span>Arjun<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अर्जुन</span></span><span>Son of Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सुपुत्र श्रीमती कविता एवं श्री अनिल मेहरा</span></span></span></h1><div aria-hidden="true"><span>Scroll<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">आगे देखें</span></span><span></span></div></div></header><section class="" data-section="saveTheDate" aria-labelledby="sec-saveTheDate"><h2 id="sec-saveTheDate"><span>Save the Date<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">तिथि याद रखें</span></span></h2><div class="_cards_e2db1c"><div class="_card_e2db1c" data-revealed="false"><p class="_cardLabel_e2db1c">Month<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">माह</span></p><div class="_cardFace_e2db1c"><span class="_cardValue_e2db1c" data-part="value" aria-hidden="true">Nov</span><button type="button" class="_cardFoil_e2db1c" aria-label="Month / माह: scratch, or press Enter to reveal / खुरचें, या देखने के लिए एंटर दबाएँ"><canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas></button></div><div class="_cardHint_e2db1c" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scratch<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">खुरचें</span></span></div></div><div class="_card_e2db1c" data-revealed="false"><p class="_cardLabel_e2db1c">Date<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दिनांक</span></p><div class="_cardFace_e2db1c"><span class="_cardValue_e2db1c" data-part="value" aria-hidden="true">27</span><button type="button" class="_cardFoil_e2db1c" aria-label="Date / दिनांक: scratch, or press Enter to reveal / खुरचें, या देखने के लिए एंटर दबाएँ"><canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas></button></div><div class="_cardHint_e2db1c" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scratch<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">खुरचें</span></span></div></div><div class="_card_e2db1c" data-revealed="false"><p class="_cardLabel_e2db1c">Year<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">वर्ष</span></p><div class="_cardFace_e2db1c"><span class="_cardValue_e2db1c" data-part="value" aria-hidden="true">2027</span><button type="button" class="_cardFoil_e2db1c" aria-label="Year / वर्ष: scratch, or press Enter to reveal / खुरचें, या देखने के लिए एंटर दबाएँ"><canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas></button></div><div class="_cardHint_e2db1c" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scratch<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">खुरचें</span></span></div></div></div><div><p>Scratch all three cards to unlock the rest of the invitation<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">निमंत्रण का बाक़ी हिस्सा देखने के लिए तीनों कार्ड खुरचें</span></p><button type="button"><span>Reveal<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दिखाएँ</span></span></button></div><div aria-live="polite"></div></section><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="countdown" aria-labelledby="sec-countdown"><h2 id="sec-countdown"><span>Counting down<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शुभ घड़ी की प्रतीक्षा</span></span></h2><div role="timer" aria-live="off"><div><span>695</span><span>Days<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दिन</span></span></div><div><span>19</span><span>Hours<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">घंटे</span></span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Minutes<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मिनट</span></span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Seconds<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सेकंड</span></span></div></div></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="venue" aria-labelledby="sec-venue"><h2 id="sec-venue"><span>Venue<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">स्थल</span></span></h2><h3>Ganga Mahal Ghat<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गंगा महल घाट</span></h3><p>Assi Ghat Road, Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अस्सी घाट रोड, वाराणसी, उत्तर प्रदेश</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="travel" aria-labelledby="sec-travel"><h2 id="sec-travel"><span>Getting there<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">कैसे पहुँचें</span></span></h2><p>Lal Bahadur Shastri Airport is 26 km away.
Varanasi Junction railway station is 7 km away.
November evenings by the river are cool — carry a light shawl.<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">लाल बहादुर शास्त्री हवाई अड्डा 26 किमी दूर है।
वाराणसी जंक्शन रेलवे स्टेशन 7 किमी दूर है।
नवंबर में नदी किनारे की शामें ठंडी होती हैं — हल्की शॉल साथ रखें।</span></p></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="schedule" aria-labelledby="sec-schedule"><h2 id="sec-schedule"><span>Celebrations<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">कार्यक्रम</span></span></h2><ol><li><h3>Haldi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हल्दी</span></h3><p>Thursday, 25 November 2027 · 10:30 am</p><p>The Courtyard<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">आँगन</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Shades of yellow<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पीले रंग</span></span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Haldi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271125T050000Z%2F20271125T080000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Courtyard%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li><li><h3>Mehendi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मेहंदी</span></h3><p>Thursday, 25 November 2027 · 4:00 pm</p><p>The Garden Terrace<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गार्डन टैरेस</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Greens and pastels<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हरा और हल्के रंग</span></span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Mehendi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&a