 lang="hi">गंगा तट पर फेरे, उसके बाद रात्रिभोज</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Vivah+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271127T133000Z%2F20271127T163000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=Ganga+Mahal+Ghat%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li><li><h3>Reception<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">स्वागत समारोह</span></h3><p>Sunday, 28 November 2027 · 8:00 pm</p><p>Ganga Mahal Ghat<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गंगा महल घाट</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Evening formal<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शाम की औपचारिक पोशाक</span></span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Reception+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271128T143000Z%2F20271128T173000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=Ganga+Mahal+Ghat%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li></ol></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="gallery" aria-labelledby="sec-gallery"><p>Forever 