ue_e2db1c" data-part="value">2027</span></div><div class="_cardHint_e2db1c" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scratch<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">खुरचें</span></span></div></div></div><div aria-live="polite"><p tabindex="-1">Saturday, 27 November 2027<span lang="hi">शनिवार, 27 नवंबर 2027</span></p></div></section><section class="" data-section="countdown" aria-labelledby="sec-countdown"><h2 id="sec-countdown"><span>Counting down<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शुभ घड़ी की प्रतीक्षा</span></span></h2><div role="timer" aria-live="off"><div><span>695</span><span>Days<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दिन</span></span></div><div><span>19</span><span>Hours<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">घंटे</span></span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Minutes<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मिनट</span></span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Seconds<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सेकंड</span></span></div></div></section><section class="" data-section="venue" aria-labelledby="sec-venue"><h2 id="sec-venue"><span>Venue<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">स्थल</span></span></h2><h3>Ganga Mahal Ghat<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गंगा महल घाट</span></h3><p>Assi Ghat Road, Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अस्सी घाट रोड, वाराणसी, उत्तर प्रदेश</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a></section><section class="" data-section="travel" aria-labelledby="sec-travel"><h2 id="sec-travel"><span>Getting there<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">कैसे पहुँचें</span></span></h2><p>Lal Bahadur Shastri Airport is 26 km away.
Varanasi Junction railway station is 7 km away.
November evenings by the river are cool — carry a light shawl.<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">लाल बहादुर शास्त्री हवाई अड्डा 26 किमी दूर है।
