type="radio" name="attending" value="yes"><span>Joyfully accept<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सहर्ष स्वीकार</span></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="no"><span>Regretfully decline<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">खेद सहित अस्वीकार</span></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="maybe"><span>Not sure yet<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अभी तय नहीं</span></span></label></fieldset><label><span>Number of guests<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अतिथियों की संख्या</span></span><input name="guestCount" type="number" min="1" max="20" inputmode="numeric" value="1"></label><fieldset><legend><span>Which celebrations will you attend?<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">आप किन कार्यक्रमों में आएँगे?</span></span></legend><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Haldi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हल्दी</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Mehendi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मेहंदी</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Sangeet<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">संगीत</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Vivah<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">विवाह</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Reception<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">स्वागत समारोह</span></span></label></fieldset><label><span>Meal preference<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">भोजन वरीयता</span></span><select name="meal"><option value="">—</option><option value="veg">Vegetarian / शाकाहारी</option><option value="nonveg">Non-vegetarian / मांसाहारी</option><option value="jain">Jain / जैन</option></select></label><label><span>Message for the couple<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दंपति के लिए संदेश</span></span><textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" value=""></label></div><button type="submit"><span>Send RSVP on WhatsApp<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">व्हाट्सऐप पर उत्तर भेजें</span></span></button></form></section><section class="" data-section="closing"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><p>With love and blessings from the Sharma and Mehra families<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शर्मा एवं मेहरा परिवार की ओर से सप्रेम</span></p><p>Warm regards<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सादर</span></p><ul><li>Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">श्रीमती सुनीता एवं श्री राजेश शर्मा</span></li><li>Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">श्रीमती कविता एवं श्री अनिल मेहरा</span></li></ul><p data-part="closing-names"><span>Meera<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मीरा</span></span> <span>&amp;</span> <span>Arjun<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अर्जुन</span></span></p><a href="tel:+91 98765 43210">+91 98765 43210</a><button type="button"><span>Share on WhatsApp<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">व्हाट्सऐप पर भेजें</span></span></button></section></main><footer><span>Created by Baba Saab Events<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">बाबा साब इवेंट्स द्वारा निर्मित</span></span></footer></div><canvas class="_petals_e2db1c" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div></div>"
