t of the invitation</p><button type="button"><span>Reveal</span></button></div><div aria-live="polite"></div></section><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="countdown" aria-labelledby="sec-countdown"><h2 id="sec-countdown"><span>Counting down</span></h2><div role="timer" aria-live="off"><div><span>695</span><span>Days</span></div><div><span>19</span><span>Hours</span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Minutes</span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Seconds</span></div></div></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="venue" aria-labelledby="sec-venue"><h2 id="sec-venue"><span>Venue</span></h2><h3>Ganga Mahal Ghat</h3><p>Assi Ghat Road, Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="travel" aria-labelledby="sec-travel"><h2 id="sec-travel"><span>Getting there</span></h2><p>Lal Bahadur Shastri Airport is 26 km away.
