November evenings by the river are cool — carry a light shawl.</p></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="schedule" aria-labelledby="sec-schedule"><h2 id="sec-schedule"><span>Celebrations</span></h2><ol><li><h3>Haldi</h3><p>Thursday, 25 November 2027 · 10:30 am</p><p>The Courtyard</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Shades of yellow</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Haldi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271125T050000Z%2F20271125T080000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Courtyard%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Mehendi</h3><p>Thursday, 25 November 2027 · 4:00 pm</p><p>The Garden Terrace</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Greens and pastels</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Mehendi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271125T103000Z%2F20271125T133000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Garden+Terrace%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Sangeet</h3><p>Friday, 26 November 2027 · 7:30 pm</p><p>The Durbar Hall</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Indo-western glamour</span></p><p>An evening of music, dance and family performances</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Sangeet+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271126T140000Z%2F20271126T170000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Durbar+Hall%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Vivah</h3><p>Saturday, 27 November 2027 · 7:00 pm</p><p>Ganga Mahal Ghat</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Traditional</span></p><p>Pheras by the Ganga, followed by dinner</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Vivah+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271127T133000Z%2F20271127T163000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=Ganga+Mahal+Ghat%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Reception</h3><p>Sunday, 28 November 2027 · 8:00 pm</p><p>Ganga Mahal Ghat</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Evening formal</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Assi+Ghat+Varanasi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Reception+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271128T143000Z%2F20271128T173000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=Ganga+Mahal+Ghat%2C+Assi+Ghat+Road%2C+Varanasi%2C+Uttar+Pradesh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li></ol></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="gallery" aria-labelledby="sec-gallery"><p>Forever us</