Not sure yet</span></label></fieldset><label><span>Number of guests</span><input name="guestCount" type="number" min="1" max="20" inputmode="numeric" value="1"></label><fieldset><legend><span>Which celebrations will you attend?</span></legend><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Haldi</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Mehendi</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Sangeet</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Vivah</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Reception</span></label></fieldset><label><span>Meal preference</span><select name="meal"><option value="">—</option><option value="veg">Vegetarian</option><option value="nonveg">Non-vegetarian</option><option value="jain">Jain</option></select></label><label><span>Message for the couple</span><textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" value=""></label></div><button type="submit"><span>Send RSVP on WhatsApp</span></button></form></section></div><div hidden="" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><section class="" data-section="closing"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><p>With love and blessings from the Sharma and Mehra families</p><p>Warm regards</p><ul><li>Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma</li><li>Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra</li></ul><p data-part="closing-names"><span>Meera</span> <span>&amp;</span> <span>Arjun</span></p><a href="tel:+91 98765 43210">+91 98765 43210</a><button type="button"><span>Share on WhatsApp</span></button></section></div></main><footer><span>Created by Baba Saab Events</span></footer></div></div></div>"
`;

