निर्विघ्नं कुरु मे देव सर्वकार्येषु सर्वदा॥</p></section><section class="" data-section="couple"><p>Together with their families<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अपने परिवारों के साथ</span></p><div><div><h3>Meera<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मीरा</span></h3><p>D/o Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सुपुत्री श्रीमती सुनीता एवं श्री राजेश शर्मा</span></p></div><div><h3>Arjun<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अर्जुन</span></h3><p>S/o Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सुपुत्र श्रीमती कविता एवं श्री अनिल मेहरा</span></p></div></div></section><section class="" data-section="saveTheDate" aria-labelledby="sec-saveTheDate"><h2 id="sec-saveTheDate"><span>Save the Date<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">तिथि याद रखें</span></span></h2><p>21 · 11 · 2027</p><p>Sunday, 21 November 2027</p><p lang="hi">रविवार, 21 नवंबर 2027</p></section><section class="" data-section="countdown" aria-labelledby="sec-countdown"><h2 id="sec-countdown"><span>Counting down<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शुभ घड़ी की प्रतीक्षा</span></span></h2><div role="timer" aria-live="off"><div><span>689</span><span>Days<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दिन</span></span></div><div><span>18</span><span>Hours<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">घंटे</span></span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Minutes<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मिनट</span></span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Seconds<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सेकंड</span></span></div></div></section><section class="" data-section="venue" aria-labelledby="sec-venue"><h2 id="sec-venue"><span>Venue<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">स्थल</span></span></h2><h3>Rajbagh Lake Palace<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">राजबाग़ लेक पैलेस</span></h3><p>Lake Pichola Road, Udaipur, Rajasthan<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">लेक पिछोला रोड, उदयपुर, राजस्थान</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a></section><div><a href="#rsvp"><span>Send your RSVP<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अपनी उपस्थिति भेजें</span></span></a></div><section class="" data-section="travel" aria-labelledby="sec-travel"><h2 id="sec-travel"><span>Getting there<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">कैसे पहुँचें</span></span></h2><p>Maharana Pratap Airport is 22 km away.
Udaipur City railway station is 4 km away.
November evenings by the lake are cool — carry a light shawl.<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">महाराणा प्रताप हवाई अड्डा 22 किमी दूर है।
उदयपुर सिटी रेलवे स्टेशन 4 किमी दूर है।
नवंबर में झील किनारे की शामें ठंडी होती हैं — हल्की शॉल साथ रखें।</span></p></section><section class="" data-section="schedule" aria-labelledby="sec-schedule"><h2 id="sec-schedule"><span>Celebrations<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">कार्यक्रम</span></span></h2><ol><li><h3>Mehendi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मेहंदी</span></h3><p>Friday, 19 November 2027 · 3:00 pm</p><p>The Garden Courtyard<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गार्डन कोर्टयार्ड</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Greens and pastels<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हरा और हल्के रंग</span></span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Mehendi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271119T093000Z%2F20271119T123000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Garden+Courtyard%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li><li><h3>Haldi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हल्दी</span></h3><p>Saturday, 20 November 2027 · 10:30 am</p><p>The Lakeside Lawn<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">लेकसाइड लॉन</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Shades of yellow<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पीले रंग</span></span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Haldi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271120T050000Z%2F20271120T080000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Lakeside+Lawn%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li><li><h3>Sangeet<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">संगीत</span></h3><p>Saturday, 20 November 2027 · 7:30 pm</p><p>The Durbar Hall<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दरबार हॉल</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Indo-western glamour<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">इंडो-वेस्टर्न</span></span></p><p>An evening of music, dance and family performances<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">संगीत, नृत्य और पारिवारिक प्रस्तुतियों की एक शाम</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Sangeet+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271120T140000Z%2F20271120T170000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Durbar+Hall%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li><li><h3>Wedding<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">विवाह</span></h3><p>Sunday, 21 November 2027 · 6:00 pm</p><p>Rajbagh Lake Palace<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">राजबाग़ लेक पैलेस</span></p><p><span>Dress code<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पोशाक</span></span>: <span>Traditional<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">पारंपरिक</span></span></p><p>Pheras under the stars, followed by dinner<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">तारों की छाँव में फेरे, उसके बाद रात्रिभोज</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल मैप्स में देखें</span></span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Wedding+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271121T123000Z%2F20271121T153000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=Rajbagh+Lake+Palace%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">गूगल कैलेंडर में जोड़ें</span></span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">डाउनलोड (.ics)</span></span></button></div></li></ol></section><section class="" data-section="gallery" aria-labelledby="sec-gallery"><h2 id="sec-gallery"><span>Our moments<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हमारे पल</span></span></h2><div><button type="button" aria-label="Open Where it began / जहाँ से शुरुआत हुई"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502635385003-ee1e6a1a742d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Where it began / जहाँ से शुरुआत हुई"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530023367847-a683933f4172?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 2"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 3"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631857455684-a54a2f03665f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 3"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 4"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623788452350-4c8596ff40bb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 4"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 5"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595407753234-0882f1e77954?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 5"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 6"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 6"></button></div></section><span id="rsvp" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="" data-section="rsvp" aria-labelledby="sec-rsvp"><h2 id="sec-rsvp"><span>RSVP<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">उपस्थिति की पुष्टि</span></span></h2><div role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><form novalidate=""><p><span>Kindly respond by<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">कृपया उत्तर दें</span></span> Sunday, 31 October 2027</p><label><span>Name<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">नाम</span></span><input name="name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" value=""></label><label><span>Phone<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">फ़ोन</span></span><input name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" value=""></label><fieldset><legend><span>Will you join us?<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">क्या आप पधारेंगे?</span></span></legend><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="yes"><span>Joyfully accept<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">सहर्ष स्वीकार</span></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="no"><span>Regretfully decline<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">खेद सहित अस्वीकार</span></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="maybe"><span>Not sure yet<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अभी तय नहीं</span></span></label></fieldset><label><span>Number of guests<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">अतिथियों की संख्या</span></span><input name="guestCount" type="number" min="1" max="20" inputmode="numeric" value="1"></label><fieldset><legend><span>Which celebrations will you attend?<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">आप किन कार्यक्रमों में आएँगे?</span></span></legend><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Mehendi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">मेहंदी</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Haldi<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">हल्दी</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Sangeet<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">संगीत</span></span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Wedding<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">विवाह</span></span></label></fieldset><label><span>Meal preference<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">भोजन वरीयता</span></span><select name="meal"><option value="">—</option><option value="veg">Vegetarian / शाकाहारी</option><option value="nonveg">Non-vegetarian / मांसाहारी</option><option value="jain">Jain / जैन</option></select></label><label><span>Message for the couple<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">दंपति के लिए संदेश</span></span><textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" value=""></label></div><button type="submit"><span>Send RSVP on WhatsApp<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">व्हाट्सऐप पर उत्तर भेजें</span></span></button></form></section><section class="" data-section="closing"><p>With best compliments from<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शुभाकांक्षी</span></p><p>With love and blessings from the Sharma and Mehra families<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">शर्मा एवं मेहरा परिवार की ओर से सप्रेम</span></p><ul><li>Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">श्रीमती सुनीता एवं श्री राजेश शर्मा</span></li><li>Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">श्रीमती कविता एवं श्री अनिल मेहरा</span></li></ul><a href="tel:+91 98765 43210">+91 98765 43210</a><button type="button"><span>Share on WhatsApp<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">व्हाट्सऐप पर भेजें</span></span></button></section></main><footer><span>Created by Baba Saab Events<span class="hiLine" lang="hi">बाबा साब इवेंट्स द्वारा निर्मित</span></span></footer></div></div></div>"
`;

