निर्विघ्नं कुरु मे देव सर्वकार्येषु सर्वदा॥</p></section><section class="" data-section="couple"><p>Together with their families</p><div><div><h3>Meera</h3><p>D/o Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma</p></div><div><h3>Arjun</h3><p>S/o Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra</p></div></div></section><section class="" data-section="saveTheDate" aria-labelledby="sec-saveTheDate"><h2 id="sec-saveTheDate"><span>Save the Date</span></h2><p>21 · 11 · 2027</p><p>Sunday, 21 November 2027</p></section><section class="" data-section="countdown" aria-labelledby="sec-countdown"><h2 id="sec-countdown"><span>Counting down</span></h2><div role="timer" aria-live="off"><div><span>689</span><span>Days</span></div><div><span>18</span><span>Hours</span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Minutes</span></div><div><span>00</span><span>Seconds</span></div></div></section><section class="" data-section="venue" aria-labelledby="sec-venue"><h2 id="sec-venue"><span>Venue</span></h2><h3>Rajbagh Lake Palace</h3><p>Lake Pichola Road, Udaipur, Rajasthan</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a></section><div><a href="#rsvp"><span>Send your RSVP</span></a></div><section class="" data-section="travel" aria-labelledby="sec-travel"><h2 id="sec-travel"><span>Getting there</span></h2><p>Maharana Pratap Airport is 22 km away.
Udaipur City railway station is 4 km away.
November evenings by the lake are cool — carry a light shawl.</p></section><section class="" data-section="schedule" aria-labelledby="sec-schedule"><h2 id="sec-schedule"><span>Celebrations</span></h2><ol><li><h3>Mehendi</h3><p>Friday, 19 November 2027 · 3:00 pm</p><p>The Garden Courtyard</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Greens and pastels</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Mehendi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271119T093000Z%2F20271119T123000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Garden+Courtyard%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Haldi</h3><p>Saturday, 20 November 2027 · 10:30 am</p><p>The Lakeside Lawn</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Shades of yellow</span></p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Haldi+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271120T050000Z%2F20271120T080000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Lakeside+Lawn%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Sangeet</h3><p>Saturday, 20 November 2027 · 7:30 pm</p><p>The Durbar Hall</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Indo-western glamour</span></p><p>An evening of music, dance and family performances</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Sangeet+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271120T140000Z%2F20271120T170000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=The+Durbar+Hall%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li><li><h3>Wedding</h3><p>Sunday, 21 November 2027 · 6:00 pm</p><p>Rajbagh Lake Palace</p><p><span>Dress code</span>: <span>Traditional</span></p><p>Pheras under the stars, followed by dinner</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Lake+Pichola+Udaipur" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Open in Google Maps</span></a><div><a href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&amp;text=Wedding+%E2%80%94+Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;dates=20271121T123000Z%2F20271121T153000Z&amp;details=Meera+%26+Arjun&amp;location=Rajbagh+Lake+Palace%2C+Lake+Pichola+Road%2C+Udaipur%2C+Rajasthan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Add to Google Calendar</span></a><button type="button"><span>Download (.ics)</span></button></div></li></ol></section><section class="" data-section="gallery" aria-labelledby="sec-gallery"><h2 id="sec-gallery"><span>Our moments</span></h2><div><button type="button" aria-label="Open Where it began"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502635385003-ee1e6a1a742d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Where it began"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530023367847-a683933f4172?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 2"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 3"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631857455684-a54a2f03665f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 3"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 4"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623788452350-4c8596ff40bb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 4"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 5"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595407753234-0882f1e77954?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 5"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Open Photo 6"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=900&amp;q=80" alt="Photo 6"></button></div></section><span id="rsvp" aria-hidden="true"></span><section class="" data-section="rsvp" aria-labelledby="sec-rsvp"><h2 id="sec-rsvp"><span>RSVP</span></h2><div role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><form novalidate=""><p><span>Kindly respond by</span> Sunday, 31 October 2027</p><label><span>Name</span><input name="name" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" value=""></label><label><span>Phone</span><input name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" value=""></label><fieldset><legend><span>Will you join us?</span></legend><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="yes"><span>Joyfully accept</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="no"><span>Regretfully decline</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="attending" value="maybe"><span>Not sure yet</span></label></fieldset><label><span>Number of guests</span><input name="guestCount" type="number" min="1" max="20" inputmode="numeric" value="1"></label><fieldset><legend><span>Which celebrations will you attend?</span></legend><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Mehendi</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Haldi</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Sangeet</span></label><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Wedding</span></label></fieldset><label><span>Meal preference</span><select name="meal"><option value="">—</option><option value="veg">Vegetarian</option><option value="nonveg">Non-vegetarian</option><option value="jain">Jain</option></select></label><label><span>Message for the couple</span><textarea name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" value=""></label></div><button type="submit"><span>Send RSVP on WhatsApp</span></button></form></section><section class="" data-section="closing"><p>With best compliments from</p><p>With love and blessings from the Sharma and Mehra families</p><ul><li>Smt. Sunita &amp; Shri Rajesh Sharma</li><li>Smt. Kavita &amp; Shri Anil Mehra</li></ul><a href="tel:+91 98765 43210">+91 98765 43210</a><button type="button"><span>Share on WhatsApp</span></button></section></main><footer><span>Created by Baba Saab Events</span></footer></div><canvas class="_petals_19a5e4" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div></div>"
`;

